{"id":"vod_zy360_65082","vodId":"65082","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"咒术回战","name_cn":"咒术回战","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全24集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241003-1/cc62ff1299d3d3ef3921679075a920b7.jpg"},"summary":"天地玄黄，森罗万象。拥有复杂情感的人类，无法想象自己会孕育出怎样恐怖阴森的存在。其实往往是简简单单的负面情绪，便可形成无法祓除、难以追悔的诅咒。17岁的高中生虎杖悠仁（榎木淳弥配音）是一个优哉游哉的体育特长生，只因他偶然捡到了一个被布条包裹的手指，便从此打开异世界的大门。为了解救同学，他吞下这根“两面宿傩之指”，于是便和特级咒物融为一体。在最强咒术师五条悟（中村悠一配音）的帮助下，虎杖进入东京都立咒术高等专门学校学习。由此开启了自己险象环生、波澜壮阔的咒术师之旅……本片根据日本漫画家芥见下下著作的漫画作品改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-10-03 19:34:52","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/2Z11ULTW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/dWyL0btu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/yTzwgaq0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/1y2xx3j8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/gUh7tDGO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/ilicGHds/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/jegfTRFS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/fFVVKuUI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/G6C9uh1u/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/9i2mAMJo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/IxIFpnNm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/h2qwqFwg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/N0CCMzdr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/nmkcJwqr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/ooj0bJdz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16话","ur